  "negative_control_method": "Pristine base source with new probe and build registration only. LEGACY_TEMP substitutes false for the unavailable deletion-pending field. The full profile fails after deterministic name collision truncates the pre-existing file; the delete-only profile confirms the DOS delete fault and closed handle, then fails because cleanup ownership was discarded.",
